entries[203543] = { ["name"] = "Vault Delver's Brigandine", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n574 Armor\n+391 [Agility or Intellect]\n+1,044 Stamina\n+ 191 Critical Strike\n+ 477 Mastery\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Rogue\nVault Delver's Toolkit (0/5)\nVault Delver's Brigandine\nVault Delver's Lockbreakers\nVault Delver's Vizard\nVault Delver's Pantaloons\nVault Delver's Epaulets\n(2) Set Assassination: Envenom also increases your weapon poisons' damage by 20%.\n(2) Set Outlaw: Dispatch increases the damage of your next Sinister Strike or Ambush by 8% per combo point spent.\n(2) Set Subtlety: Eviscerate and Black Powder increase the damage and critical strike chance of your next [ Gloomblade / Backstab], Shadowstrike, or Shuriken Storm by 2% per combo point spent.\n(4) Set Assassination: When your weapon poisons deal direct damage, you have a 50% chance to gain Septic Wounds, increasing all Bleed damage done by 4% for 8 sec, stacking up to 5 times. (Proc chance: 50%)\n(4) Set Outlaw: Half-cost uses of Pistol Shot granted by Sinister Strike increase the damage of your next Dispatch by 25%.\n(4) Set Subtlety: [ Gloomblade / Backstab], Shadowstrike, and Shuriken Storm critical strikes increase the damage of Eviscerate and Rupture by 12% and the damage of Black Powder by 8% for 3 sec.\nSell Price:" }
